<title>FINLAND: LANSIVOIMA 1996 PROFIT RISES 60 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>LANSIVOIMA 1996 PROFIT RISES 60 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     144 vs 90</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  19.22 vs 12.19</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,134 vs 923</p>
<p> Operating profit				   168 vs 106</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    6.50 vs 2.80</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 308 vs 224</p>
<p> Depreciation					 141 vs 118</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 23 vs 16 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			   gain 9 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  153 vs 90</p>
<p> Net profit					    54 vs 40</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish energy group is Lansivoima Oy.</p>
<p>Lansivoima is subsidiary of state-owned energy group Imatran</p>
<p>Voima Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
